x print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Bowers RC, Vivolo JC. Disorders due to Physical &amp; Environmental Agents. In: Stone C, Humphries RL, eds. <em>CURRENT Diagnosis &amp; Treatment: Emergency Medicine</em>. 8th ed. McGraw-Hill Education; 2017.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Critchley LAH. Electrical safety and injuries. In: Bersten AD, Handy JM, eds. <em>Oh’s Intensive Care Manual</em>. 8th ed. Elsevier Inc. 2019:999-1005.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Merck Manual. Electrical injury <span class="break-words">consumer version<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://www.merckmanuals.com/home/injuries-and-poisoning/electrical-and-lightning-injuries/electrical-injuries<!-- -->)</em></span> and <span class="break-words">professional version<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://www.merckmanuals.com/professional/injuries-poisoning/electrical-and-lightning-injuries/electrical-injuries<!-- -->)</em></span> pages Accessed 11/14/2025.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Navarrete N. Lightning and Electrical Injuries. In: Tenenbein M, Macias CG, Sharieff GQ, Yamamoto LG, Schafermeyer R, eds. <em>Strange and Schafermeyer’s Pediatric Emergency Medicine</em>. 5th ed. McGraw-Hill Education; 2019.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Price LA, Loiacono LA. Electrical and Lightning Injury. In: Cameron JL, Cameron AM, eds. <em>Current Surgical Therapy</em>. 14th ed. Elsevier Inc. 2023:1433-1442.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Svendsen TB, Bærheim D, Dale J, et al. <span class="break-words">Patients with low-voltage electric shock referred to an Emergency Department<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35026093/<!-- -->)</em></span>. <em>Tidsskr Nor Laegeforen</em>. 2021 Jan;141(1):10.4045/tidsskr.21.0415. Accessed 11/14/2025.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Zemaitis MR, Guirguis M, Cindass R. <span class="break-words">Electrical Injuries<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK448087/<!-- -->)</em></span>. 2025 Jul 6. In: <em>StatPearls</em> [Internet]. Treasure Island (FL): StatPearls Publishing; 2025 Jan. Accessed 11/14/2025.</li></ul></div></div><div data-identity="social-share-links" class="mt-rem56px border-b pb-rem32px border-gray-400 print:hidden"><div class="gap-rem24px flex flex-wrap"><button data-identity="social-share-link-facebook" class="group w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-full bg-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-400 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="18" viewBox="0 0 10 18" fill="none" role="img" class="fill-gray-700 group-hover:fill-gray-800 max-w-[20px] max-h-[20px]" aria-label="Facebook"><path d="M6.3 10.35H8.55L9.45 6.75H6.3V4.95C6.3 4.023 6.3 3.15 8.1 3.15H9.45V0.126C9.1566 0.0873001 8.0487 0 6.8787 0C4.4352 0 2.7 1.4913 2.7 4.23V6.75H0V10.35H2.7V18H6.3V10.35Z"></path></svg></button><button data-identity="social-share-link-twitter" class="group w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-full bg-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-400 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="15" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" role="img" class="fill-gray-700 group-hover:fill-gray-800 max-w-[20px] max-h-[20