2px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Electrical lines (like power lines or transmission lines)\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"11d1a84392bf\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Getting water on household appliances, outlets or electrical switches\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"e8b55bdf7732\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Lightning strikes (not common)\"]}]]}]\n66:[\"$\",\"p\",\"e1e7141c3db0\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"There are a few main ways that electricity might reach and hurt you. The injury patterns they cause are:\"]}]\n67:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"a8040a6eead0-parent\",{\"data-identity\":\"unordered-list\",\"className\":\"my-rem16px mx-0 pl-[1.25rem] list-disc marker:text-brandBlue-500 print:marker:text-black marker:pl-rem24px print:my-rem8px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal  \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"a8040a6eead0\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-g"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"03f2daf28442\",{\"children\":[\"Flash or arc injuries\"]}],\": These happen when electricity arcs — or jumps — from point to point. Arcs usually travel along your skin surface. They don’t usually cause internal injuries.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5faed93297d1\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"6cdbb4c6eaba\",{\"children\":[\"Flame injuries\"]}],\": When electricity can’t travel through something easily, some of the energy converts to heat. That can set things (like your clothes) on fire, causing burns.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"b9b4ac1c1c69\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"22dfa22b6d2d\",{\"children\":[\"True electrical injuries\"]}],\": These happen when an electrical current flows through you, making you part of the circuit. The longer you’re part of the circuit, the worse these injuries are. Higher voltages and amperages can also make these injuries worse.\"]}]]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",\"f2f794c5794a\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"Dry skin doesn’t conduct electricity well, but wet skin does. That’s why electricity and water are so dangerous together. At higher voltages, electricity can also travel through your skin easier even when it’s dry. That’s why higher voltages are more dangerous.\"]}]\n69:[\"$\",\"div\",\"f2f794c5794a_mobile_ad\",{\"data-identity\":\"billboard-ad\",\"className\":\"flex bp1100:hidden print:hidden max-w-[400px] min-w-[300px] m-auto items-center justify-center bg-gray-300 pt-rem16px pb-[3.125rem] my-rem32px  \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[300px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-800 uppercase text-rem10px leading-rem16px mx-auto w-fit\",\"children\":\"Advertisement\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex bp1100:hidden flex-col items-center justify-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-identity\":\"ad-slot\",\"id\":\"billboard6_300x250_mobile\",\"className\":\"ad-reset w-[300px] !min-h-[250px] flex bg-gray-300\"}],null]}]]}]}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"3a39ebd06990\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"While your skin doesn’t conduct electricity well, lots of things inside your body do. Your blood vessels, muscles and nerves (especially your spinal cord) are all good conductors. And organs that use electricity a lot, like your heart and brain, are both very vulnerable to electric shocks.\"]}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"a3ffc294ad80\",{\"data-identity\":\"headline\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem30px text-rem25px bp600:text-rem32px bp600:leading-rem38px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold mt-rem32px mb-rem16px break-words print:mt-rem12px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold print:mb-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"Complications of electric shock\"]}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4053f6069a90\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"Electric shock can cause many complications, and several of them are dangerous. Some of the possible complications include:\"]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"257f11189814-parent\",{\"data-identity\":\"unordered-list\",\"className\":\"my-rem16px mx-0 pl-[1.25rem] list-disc marker:text-brandBlue-500 print:marker:text-black marker:pl-rem24px print:my-rem8px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal  \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"257f11189814\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Coma and/or memory loss\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"83c35733a0aa\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Dehydration and electrolyte imbalances\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"361cff137cf2\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Infections (especially if the shock causes electrical burns)\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3ee032878b52\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Internal injuries like dying tissue (\",[\"$\",\"a\",\"b08ce55409ae\",{\"data-identity\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/23959-necrosis\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brandBlue-500 print:text-black underline underline-offset-[5px] print:no-underline decoration-1 break-words hover:text-blue-800 transition\",\"children\":[\"necrosis\"]}],\") or \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"ec93a977507c\",{\"data-identity\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/15315-compartment-syndrome\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brandBlue-500 print:text-black underline underline-offset-[5px] print:no-underline decoration-1 break-words hover:text-blue-800 transition\",\"children\":[\"compartment syndrome\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"086636d7fc32\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Irregular heart rhythms or \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"375eee85db70\",{\"data-identity\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/21736-cardiac-arrest\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brandBlue-500 print:text-black underline underline-offset-[5px] print:no-underline decoration-1 break-words hover:text-blue-800 transition\",\"children\":[\"cardiac arrest\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"7c4df2aa4219\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Mental health conditions like anxiety, depression or PTSD\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"64c47f8077ea\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Muscle damage (rhabdomyolysis), which can lead to kidney damage or failure\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"27beb504e45d\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Respiratory arrest (where you can’t breathe on your own)\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"85ddd7f038b1\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Vision issues like cataracts (these are a long-term complication and can happen years later)\"]}]]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"1032c2b08223\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"e65af021fe2c\",{\"data-identity\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diagnostics/24508-blood-tests\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brandBlue-500 print:text-black underline underline-offset-[5px] print:no-underline decoration-1 break-words hover:text-blue-800 transition\",\"children\":[\"Blood tests\"]}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"8b21613293da\",{\"data-identity\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diagnostics/17893-urinalysis\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brandBlue-500 print:text-black underline underline-offset-[5px] print:no-underline decoration-1 break-words hover:text-blue-800 transition\",\"children\":[\"urinalysis\"]}],\" to check fo"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"r damage to your heart, muscles or blood vessels\"]}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"98da2f5da671\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[\"Imaging scans like X-rays, CT scan or MRI to look for signs of internal injuries that could otherwise go undetected\"]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"strong\",\"295423aff2e0\",{\"children\":[\"Protect them from further injury\"]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"strong\",\"b1dd28f50d97\",{\"children\":[\" \"]}]\n72:[\"$\",\"div\",\"9c57c2594bc7_mobile_ad\",{\"data-identity\":\"billboard-ad\",\"className\":\"flex bp1100:hidden print:hidden max-w-[400px] min-w-[300px] m-auto items-center justify-center bg-gray-300 pt-rem16px pb-[3.125rem] my-rem32px  \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[300px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-800 uppercase text-rem10px leading-rem16px mx-auto w-fit\",\"children\":\"Advertisement\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex bp1100:hidden flex-col items-center justify-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-identity\":\"ad-slot\",\"id\":\"billboard4_300x250_mobile\",\"className\":\"ad-reset w-[300px] !min-h-[250px] flex bg-gray-300\"}],null]}]]}]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"9661e431c899\",{\"data-identity\":\"headline\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem24px text-rem20px bp600:text-rem25px bp600:leading-rem30px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-bold mt-rem32px mb-rem16px break-words print:mt-rem12px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold print:mb-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"Medical care for electric shocks\"]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57694f0fc046\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"There’s no way to treat electric shock directly. Instead, treatments help the effects and symptoms of the shock. The treatments can include:\"]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"4ca5470f8fe7-parent\",{\"data-identity\":\"unordered-list\",\"className\":\"my-rem16px mx-0 pl-[1.25rem] list-disc marker:text-brandBlue-500 print:marker:text-black marker:pl-rem24px print:my-rem8px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal  \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"4ca5470f8fe7\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"e70b5030d9ba\",{\"children\":[\"Medicines\"]}],\": These include drugs for pain, seizures or irregular heart rhythms.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"34da69f61cfe\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"40891ab5298c\",{\"children\":[\"IV fluids\"]}],\": These treat dehydration, electrolyte imbalances and other common effects of electric shock.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"98f6ee18885c\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"c98d436ffc1f\",{\"children\":[\"Treatments for complications: \"]}],\"These include surgery to stop compartment syndrome or dialysis for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"bd3f23b543dc\",{\"data-identity\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/21184-rhabdomyolysis\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brandBlue-500 print:text-black underline underline-offset-[5px] print:no-underline decoration-1 break-words hover:text-blue-800 transition\",\"children\":[\"rhabdomyolysis\"]}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"f49b2c2e428d\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"20db41d0f96c\",{\"children\":[\"Life support\"]}],\": People who get shocked might not be able to breathe on their own. Putting them on a ventilator can help them breathe until they can do it on their own.\"]}]]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"a5c800859122\",{\"data-identity\":\"headline\",\"id\":\"$u"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ndefined\",\"className\":\"text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem30px text-rem25px bp600:text-rem32px bp600:leading-rem38px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold mt-rem32px mb-rem16px break-words print:mt-rem12px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold print:mb-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"When should I see my healthcare provider?\"]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5379f117d4cd\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"Anyone who receives an electric shock should get medical care, even when there aren’t any noticeable symptoms. The type of care needed depends on the type of shock and other details.\"]}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",\"0795dfa7a186\",{\"data-identity\":\"paragraph-element\",\"className\":\"text-gray-800 my-rem16px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:my-rem8px  \",\"children\":[\"In general, the following apply:\"]}]\n79:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"3a7629ef46d6-parent\",{\"data-identity\":\"unordered-list\",\"className\":\"my-rem16px mx-0 pl-[1.25rem] list-disc marker:text-brandBlue-500 print:marker:text-black marker:pl-rem24px print:my-rem8px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal  \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"3a7629ef46d6\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0f9b1fb31c2f\",{\"children\":[\"For all high-voltage electric shocks\"]}],\": Call 911 (or your local emergency services number) or go to your nearest hospital or emergency room immediately.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"7ee296681850\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"618c18e3db5c\",{\"children\":[\"For low-voltage electric shocks with burns\"]}],\": Go to the emergency room. Don’t try to treat the burn at home.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"6ad872ad60a5\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"db1952f02bf2\",{\"children\":[\"For lightning-related electric shocks\"]}],\": These always need emergency care. Call 911 or your local emergency services number for anyone who is struck by lightning.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3eb9cd07c98a\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"d350a8252784\",{\"children\":[\"For children with electrical injuries\"]}],\":\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"bf91a3435710\",{\"children\":[\" \"]}],\"Children with electrical injuries to their mouths or faces always need emergency care. Children without injuries should see a pediatrician within 48 hours.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"0313dd0769f9\",{\"className\":\"mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem19px leading-rem34px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"46a81d078abd\",{\"children\":[\"For low-voltage electric shocks without burns\"]}],\": See a healthcare provider within 48 hours. Treatments for internal electric shock injuries are most effective within that window of time.\"]}]]}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"0313dd0769f9_mobile_ad\",{\"data-identity\":\"billboard-ad\",\"className\":\"flex bp1100:hidden print:hidden max-w-[400px] min-w-[300px] m-auto items-center justify-center bg-gray-300 pt-rem16px pb-[3.125rem] my-rem32px  \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[300px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-800 uppercase text-rem10px leading-rem16px mx-auto w-fit\",\"children\":\"Advertisement\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex bp1100:hidden flex-col items-center justify-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-identity\":\"ad-slot\",\"id\":\"billboard5_300x250_mobile\",\"className\":\"ad-reset w-[300px] !min-h-[250px] flex bg-gray-300\"}],null]}]]}]}]\n7b:"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-identity\":\"callout-container\",\"className\":\"bp900:hidden mx-auto w-fit print:hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"data-identity\":\"callout\",\"className\":\"flex flex-col justify-start max-w-[375px] bp600:max-w-[856px] bp900:max-w-[375px] bp600:gap-x-rem32px mt-rem48px bp900:mt-0 mb-rem32px\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t-[5px] [width:40px] border-forestGreen-500 bp900:w-full\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-rem16px pb-rem24px items-center flex align-middle\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"width\":\"39\",\"height\":\"39\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 39 39\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"className\":\"flex-none mr-rem8px\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"g\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"data-identity\":\"callout-logo